Package: apic
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: Git-friendly API contracts, command line and terminal UI
 apic stores API contracts as plain JSON in your repository, diffable and
 reviewable like code rather than locked inside a hosted tool.
 .
 This package provides the apic command line tool and its terminal UI.

Package: apic-gui
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, git, hicolor-icon-theme
Recommends: xdg-desktop-portal
Description: Git-friendly API contracts, desktop GUI
 apic stores API contracts as plain JSON in your repository, diffable and
 reviewable like code rather than locked inside a hosted tool.
 .
 This package provides the desktop GUI, which shares the same contract engine
 as the command line tool. Open a project folder to browse, edit or repair
 contracts, and use the built in git panel to stage, commit, switch branches
 and resolve merge conflicts.
